    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "WELCOME TO\nMain Cabin\nMARVEL STUDIOS\nCAPTAIN\nMARVEL\nOn Digital 1o8 Moves May 28th - On Blu-ray™ June 11th\nNew On 4K Ultra HO™\nMake time fly with the\nMost Free Movies in the Sky.\nPAGE 2 GOOD FOOD, GOOD MOOD\nEnjoy sandwiches, snacks\n\u0026 platters from the freshest coast.\nPAGE 4\nHAVE A NICE SIP\nWe're raising the bar - from bubbles\nand brews to sodas and spirits.\nPAGE 6\nJUST PLANE ENTERTAINING\nSend free texts and watch\nnew releases \u0026 TV shows.\nCompared to other U.S. airlines as of Dec. 2018. Movies are available to\nstream to guest's own device, on flights with Gogo Entertainment."
